Environment 

The environment is also important issue when talking about online shopping. Companies like Amazon and Ebay make shopping easier, but their deliveries and packaging can also cause some problems for the environment.
According to an "AP News", fast delivery can increase pollution because delivery cars and trucks sometimes make extra trips or travel without being completely full, also infotmation from "MIT" that fast can increase emissions by around 10-12%.
This shows that even something simple as ordering a product for next-day delivery can have environmental impact.
However, there also some postive changes, Amazon has been working on electric delivery cars and reducing plastic packaging. Ebay also trying to make people to buy second-hand products instead of buying new ones, this can help reduce waste because 
products better are going to be reused than thrown away.
In my opinion, both companies need to protect the environment, they can use less plastic, improve their delivery system and make customers choose standart delivery instead of always have fast one. They shuold also avoid using too much packiging 
when sending products to customers.
Overall, online shopping makes life much easier for people, and its great that we have this option, but companies should also remember that protecting the environment is important for the our future.